[2025-08-24 11:33:11,714.714] DEBUG    [MainThread|MainProcess] Logger (client.py:handle_group_event:67) | {'group_id': '465281893', 'user_id': '3863501516', 'message_type': 'group', 'sub_type': 'normal', 'font': '14', 'sender': "{'user_id': 3863501516, 'nickname': 'jvav大蛇', 'card': 'EricDing618小号'}", 'message_id': '17013387', 'message_seq': '17013387', 'real_id': '17013387', 'message': '[{\'type\': \'text\', \'data\': {\'text\': \'实现示例\\n\\n下面是一个使用MathJax的完整HTML页面示例：\\n\\n```html\\n<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang="zh-CN">\\n<head>\\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\\n    <title>LaTeX公式显示示例</title>\\n    <script>\\n        MathJax = {\\n            tex: {\\n                inlineMath: [[\\\'$\\\', \\\'$\\\'], [\\\'\\\\\\\\(\\\', \\\'\\\\\\\\)\\\']],\\n                displayMath: [[\\\'$$\\\', \\\'$$\\\'], [\\\'\\\\\\\\[\\\', \\\'\\\\\\\\]\\\']]\\n            },\\n            svg: {\\n                fontCache: \\\'global\\\'\\n            }\\n        };\\n    </script>\\n    <script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js"></script>\\n    <style>\\n        body {\\n            font-family: \\\'Segoe UI\\\', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\\n            max-width: 800px;\\n            margin: 0 auto;\\n            padding: 20px;\\n            line-height: 1.6;\\n            color: #333;\\n            background-color: #f8f9fa;\\n        }\\n        h1 {\\n            color: #2c3e50;\\n            text-align: center;\\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db;\\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\\n        }\\n        .container {\\n            background-color: white;\\n            border-radius: 8px;\\n            padding: 25px;\\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\\n        }\\n        .example {\\n            background-color: #f8f9fa;\\n            border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\\n            padding: 15px;\\n            margin: 20px 0;\\n            border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\\n        }\\n        code {\\n            background-color: #eee;\\n            padding: 2px 5px;\\n            border-radius: 3px;\\n            font-family: monospace;\\n        }\\n        .formula {\\n            margin: 15px 0;\\n            padding: 10px;\\n            text-align: center;\\n            background-color: #f0f7ff;\\n            border-radius: 5px;\\n        }\\n        .footer {\\n            text-align: center;\\n            margin-top: 30px;\\n            font-size: 0.9em;\\n            color: #7f8c8d;\\n        }\\n    </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n    <div class="container">\\n        <h1>在HTML中显示LaTeX公式</h1>\\n        \\n        <p>使用MathJax库可以轻松地在网页中显示LaTeX数学公式。</p>\\n        \\n        <h2>行内公式</h2>\\n        <p>使用单美元符号或反斜杠括号：</p>\\n        <div class="example">\\n            <code>爱因斯坦的质能方程：$E = mc^2$</code>\\n            <div class="formula">爱因斯坦的质能方程：$E = mc^2$</div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <div class="example">\\n            <code>二次方程公式：\\\\\\\\(x = \\\\frac{-b \\\\pm \\\\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}\\\\\\\\)</code>\\n            <div class="formula">二次方程公式：\\\\(x = \\\\frac{-b \\\\pm \\\\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}\\\\)</div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <h2>显示模式公式</h2>\\n        <p>使用双美元符号或方括号：</p>\\n        <div class="example">\\n            <code>$$ \\\\int_{-\\\\infty}^{\\\\infty} e^{-x^2} dx = \\\\sqrt{\\\\pi} $$</code>\\n            <div class="formula">$$ \\\\int_{-\\\\infty}^{\\\\infty} e^{-x^2} dx = \\\\sqrt{\\\\pi} $$</div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <div class="example">\\n            <code>\\\\\\\\[ \\\\sum_{n=1}^{\\\\infty} \\\\frac{1}{n^2} = \\\\frac{\\\\pi^2}{6} \\\\\\\\]</code>\\n            <div class="formula">\\\\[ \\\\sum_{n=1}^{\\\\infty} \\\\frac{1}{n^2} = \\\\frac{\\\\pi^2}{6} \\\\]</div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <h2>更复杂的例子</h2>\\n        <div class="example">\\n            <code>$$ \\\\nabla \\\\times \\\\vec{B} - \\\\frac{1}{c} \\\\frac{\\\\partial \\\\vec{E}}{\\\\partial t} = \\\\frac{4\\\\pi}{c} \\\\vec{J} $$</code>\\n            <div class="formula">$$ \\\\nabla \\\\times \\\\vec{B} - \\\\frac{1}{c} \\\\frac{\\\\partial \\\\vec{E}}{\\\\partial t} = \\\\frac{4\\\\pi}{c} \\\\vec{J} $$</div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <div class="example">\\n            <code>\\\\\\\\[ f(x) = \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sigma\\\\sqrt{2\\\\pi}} e^{-\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\frac{x-\\\\mu}{\\\\sigma}\\\\right)^2} \\\\\\\\]</code>\\n            <div class="formula">\\\\[ f(x) = \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sigma\\\\sqrt{2\\\\pi}} e^{-\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\frac{x-\\\\mu}{\\\\sigma}\\\\right)^2} \\\\]</div>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <div class="footer">\\n            <p>使用MathJax 3渲染 | 公式可能需要几秒钟时间加载</p>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n```\\n\\n其他选择\\n\\n如果您想使用KaTeX，只需将MathJax的脚本替换为：\\n\\n```html\\n<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/katex.min.css">\\n<script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/katex.min.js"></script>\\n<script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/contrib/auto-render.min.js" onload="renderMathInElement(document.body);"></script>\\n```\\n\\n注意事项\\n\\n1. 公式可能需要一些时间加载和渲染，特别是当页面包含大量公式时\\n2. 确保LaTeX语法正确，否则可能导致渲染错误\\n3. 对于复杂的公式，MathJax通常提供更好的支持，而KaTeX提供更快的渲染速度\\n\\n您可以直接将上面的HTML代码保存为.html文件并在浏览器中打开，即可查看效果。\'}}]', 'message_format': 'array'}
